  "contract": [
    "Input: the bare form name F from _setFilename, the language index L and the sqwt root R, which is client/sqwt or client/sqwt/boot for the boot modes.",
    "Let N be F + .form. When N is Desktop.form every attempt path is \\common\\Desktop.form.",
    "Otherwise the attempt paths are \\widget\\ + N, \\debug\\ + N and \\ + N, in that order.",
    "For each attempt path P in order, replace every / in P with \\, then test P with the token of L inserted before the trailing .form, then test P itself.",
    "The token is ja, en, de, fr, chs or cht for L 0 to 5 and empty for any other L, which leaves two dots.",
    "A candidate matches when R + candidate names an existing regular file. The first match ends the search and is the form file.",
    "When none of the six tests matches the load fails with request id -1.",
    "A literal form path of a C++ owner gets the same / to \\ rewrite and is tested with the insertion and the plain path only. A template path that reaches the same opener is handled the same way. A Source reference inside a form is read as written.",
    "The .sd files are not addressed by this rule."
  ],
  "open": [
    {
      "label": "INFERRED",
      "text": "0x00446fd0 forwards to 0x00446800 and is read as a reverse search from the end of the string. A forward search would shorten a dotted name to its first segment."
    },
    {
      "label": "INFERRED",
      "text": "The Source reference reader 0x00983be0 does not reach the token. This reading follows direct calls only and virtual calls are not followed."
    },
    {
      "label": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "No loader of the .sd.form and .sd.tpl files is found. The pinned executable holds no sd path suffix literal."
    },
    {
      "label": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "The 0x2f branch of 0x00452d50 at 0x00452e7a is not decoded. The opener passes only the character 0x5c."
    },
    {
      "label": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "The order and fallback of the texture reader 0x008e2f40 and the file reader 0x009a1db0 are not decoded."
    },
    {
      "label": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "The directory that 0x00405210 supplies for config.lng is not traced."
    },
    {
      "label": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "The test that selects the LATEST registry key name, 0x00405080, is read only as far as a \\latest.txt probe. The string at 0x01323898 that gates the name is not traced."
    },
    {
      "label": "CALIBRATION",
      "text": "The language index a loader uses when no config.lng or registry value exists is an owner choice."
    }
  ],
